<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Adaptive icon foreground: the myvitals "orbit markers" mark — three
     quiet tracks with a fat endpoint bead riding each, the same "today"
     marker the charts draw. Sleep (magenta) / move (lime) / recovery
     (cyan).

     Scaled to 0.87 about the centre: at full size the outer bead's halo
     reached r=37.6 from centre, so a circular launcher mask (r=36, and a
     66dp safe circle of r=33) would have shaved the one element carrying
     the identity. The dotted inter-bead tracks from the web mark are
     omitted — VectorDrawable has no stroke-dasharray, and they are
     sub-pixel at launcher size anyway. -->
